                        <Viewbox Width="10" Height="10" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"><Path Data="M1,0 L5,4 L9,0 L10,1 L6,5 L10,9 L9,10 L5,6 L1,10 L0,9 L4,5 L0,1 Z" Fill="White"/></Viewbox>
